sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (browser)
    participant P as platform-api
    participant T as talent-api
    participant A as admin-api

    Note over U,P: Login (Dev Identity Mode / future Entra ID)
    U->>P: POST /api/auth/dev-login {persona_key}
    P->>P: AuthorizationService resolves<br/>platform_permissions + module_roles<br/>+ client scope from DB
    P-->>U: JWT with signed claims<br/>{platform_permissions, module_roles: {...}}

    Note over U,T: Business service request — no DB join, no call to platform-api
    U->>T: GET /api/talent/requests<br/>Authorization: Bearer <JWT>
    T->>T: decode_claims() verifies signature,<br/>reads module_roles["talent-flow"] locally
    T-->>U: 200 (tenant-scoped response)

    Note over U,A: Admin request — pass-through auth, re-derived by Platform Core
    U->>A: PATCH /api/admin/users/6/status<br/>Authorization: Bearer <JWT>
    A->>P: PATCH /api/platform/admin/users/6/status<br/>Authorization: Bearer <JWT> (forwarded, unmodified)
    P->>P: require_platform_permission(...)<br/>re-derives actor's permissions from THIS token
    P-->>A: 200
    A-->>U: 200

    Note over T,P: Service-initiated write — no human actor
    T->>P: POST /api/platform/internal/audit-events<br/>X-Internal-Token: shared secret
    P-->>T: 201 (or logged warning + non-fatal continue if unreachable)
